    "description": "Sinflarni qo‘shing. .page - grid-template-areas li display: grid (header, main, aside, footer); har bir blokka - grid-area; .gallery - repeat(auto-fit, minmax(..., 1fr)) va gap; .featured - grid-column: span 2. float va style=\"\" siz.",
    "starter_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"uz\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Loyihalar galereyasi</title>\n    <!-- <style>: .page (grid-template-areas), sohalar, .gallery, .featured -->\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header>\n        <p>Veb-dasturlash to‘garagi</p>\n    </header>\n    <main>\n        <h1>Loyihalar galereyasi</h1>\n        <div>\n            <img src=\"images/1.jpg\" alt=\"Noutbukdagi portfolio sayti\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\">\n            <img src=\"images/2.jpg\" alt=\"Telefondagi kafe menyusi\" width=\"200\" height=\"250\">\n            <img src=\"images/3.jpg\" alt=\"Kutubxona katalogi\" width=\"200\" height=\"250\">\n            <img src=\"images/4.jpg\" alt=\"To‘garakka yozilish formasi\" width=\"200\" height=\"250\">\n        </div>\n    </main>\n    <aside>\n        <h2>Yaqin mashg‘ulotlar</h2>\n        <p>Chorshanba, 15:00.</p>\n    </aside>\n    <footer>\n        <p>&copy; 2026 To‘garak</p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
